Package: jaos
Type: Package
Title: JAOS, an LP, MIP, QP and SOCP Solver
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Vall", email = "vall@jaos.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The JAOS C library from R: models read from MPS, LP, NL,
    QPLIB, OSiL and CBF files or built from vectors, solved, and read back
    with their values, duals, certificates and branch-and-bound report.
